  "verbalization": "Pestaloficiol A is implicated in the biological activity of SNB-78 through a chain of targets that includes SK-VLB, A2780cisR, and KB. These entities are all targets of 5-Hydroxy-6,8-Dimethoxy-2,3-Dimethylbenzo[G]Chromen-4-One, a compound that appears to be a central mediator in the interaction between Pestaloficiol A and SNB-78. The consistent presence of this intermediate in multiple paths suggests a robust, if indirect, mechanism by which Pestaloficiol A influences SNB-78. The evidence supports a pathway where Pestaloficiol A acts as a modulator, potentially through the activation or inhibition of the target compound, which in turn affects SNB-78. The overlapping targets and the high scores in the paths indicate that the relationship is well-supported, though the exact nature of the interaction remains to be elucidated.",
